INDUSTRY COMPLIANCE

This design was developed for the automotive industry and is designed with
Class 3 (high-reliability electronic products) requirements in mind, for
hot-air rework and handling of PCBs that are sensitive to electrostatic
discharge.

The design consists of a metal base plate recessed in a 3D-printed
ESD-dissipative frame and repositionable cone-shaped supports held to the
plate by neodymium magnets.

ESD Compliance (target): IEC 61340-5-1
Class 3 (target):        IPC-A-610 Class 3, IPC-7711/7721
Material:                ESD PETG
Application:             ESD-safe base for PCB rework

